{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは、渡辺です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/04/13/5030515/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間、れなちとちょっとした\n美術展に行ってきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お互い好きな絵とかが合うので\n見ててとっても楽しかったし、\n久しぶりに心が癒されました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで最近は美術展巡り\nしたくていろいろ調べています。\nどこかおすすめ、又は行ってみたい\n美術展や展覧会ありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ教えてください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/04/13/5030515/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/04/13/5030515/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つんつん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎質問に答える◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛の1番好きなお菓子は何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→ん〜、チョコやグミはやっぱり王道！\n1番とか決められないです(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛の靴のサイズは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→23cm〜23.5cmです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛は男性に\n「これ歌われたらキュンとしちゃう」\nみたいな歌はありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→AAAさんの「さよならの前に」\nアーティストさんで言うと\nSEKAI NO OWARIさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・集計は「正」の字を紙に書いてあるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→そうなんですよ〜。\n見せてあげたいくらい「正」の文字が\nノートにずっしり書いてあります、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・普段靴ってスニーカーが多い？\nそれともブーツとかが多い？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→断然スニーカーです！\n歩きやすさを重視しちゃうし、\nスニーカーのデザインが素敵なの\n多いじゃないですか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スニーカーすき♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆質問の名前が決定しました！！\nその名も、「みりあんさー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんコメントにたくさん案を\n書いてくださりありがとうございました。\n嬉しいことに決まりました(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここで、質問返しも題名つけたら？\nの意見を頂いたので\n質問返しのタイトル名も募集\nしたいと思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみに待ってますので\n宜しくお願いします(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで前回のみりあんさーは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分が1番落ち着く場所は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多かった順に紹介させていただきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1位 布団の中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2位 自分の部屋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3位 ペットの上"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4位 トイレ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5位 お風呂"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部屋の右側の隅っこと\n書いた方もいますが、何かわかるきがする"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のみりあんさーは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分に気合を入れる方法は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントにてお待ちしています(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はひめかさんのお誕生日！\nおめでとうございます\nプレゼントは渡しましたよ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい年にしてくださいね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お泊まりは行かせていただきますよ？\nふふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いよいよ今週末全国握手会\n個別握手会ですね〜\n楽しみにお待ちしております♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}